{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願文附後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此淨法界真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經呪載功課本中，念佛儀式附後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄蕅益大師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節引徹悟禪師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮拜四十八願儀式附後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄徹悟禪師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參用蕅益大師徹悟禪師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錄憨山大師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參用妙叶禪師語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平時亦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "千拜，　至少百拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一日如是，第\n二日不用經呪，休息纔醒，即持佛名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "切莫貪睡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若大眾七期道場，有省菴法師、\n截流大師七期規式一。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀文附後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "節錄二林居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如永明、智者、天如、蓮池、憨\n山、紫柏、蕅益諸書，近今如省庵截流徹悟語錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或千聲或三千聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者至佛前，在客途，即向西諦想聖容，如在璃琉寶地，親聞說法。想已，念："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盡一氣為一念如是十念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者至道場內，諦信：橫徧十方，豎窮三際，全是彌陀大誓願海。我今以此念佛因緣，得入如來大誓海中。\n想已，然後至心合掌，如對佛前，三稱：南無阿彌陀佛。稱已，　唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "低聲誦云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜下，想第一願。"}
